# reader2 component directory. A qmldir is REQUIRED here so Theme can be a real
# singleton (referenced as `Theme.gold`, not instantiated). Once a qmldir exists,
# Qt stops auto-scanning the folder for types, so EVERY reader2 component that is
# referenced by name must be listed below — otherwise sibling references (e.g.
# Harness -> ReaderShell -> Paper/ReaderChrome) fail to resolve.
singleton Theme Theme.qml
Paper Paper.qml
ReaderShell ReaderShell.qml
ReaderChrome ReaderChrome.qml
TopBar TopBar.qml
BottomRail BottomRail.qml
LeftPanel LeftPanel.qml
SelectionMenu SelectionMenu.qml
HarnessShelf HarnessShelf.qml
Harness Harness.qml
